{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short adventure where you fight enemies in a series of wave-based encounters. Completing the encounters opens up the world more for you to explore. Prepare in between encounters by crafting consumables to survive the next fight.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo: only the first 4 stages are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable encounter stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression (max player Level 5).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, the Swordslash and Blast Arrow abilities are unlocked earlier.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3662110?t=1762503656","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3662110?t=1762503656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662110/3410ed83708bc39451498c00cbf2d44617aec385/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762503656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662110/3410ed83708bc39451498c00cbf2d44617aec385/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762503656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short adventure where you fight enemies in a series of wave-based encounters. Completing the encounters opens up the world more for you to explore. Prepare in between encounters by crafting consumables to survive the next fight.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo: only the first 4 stages are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Featu